WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.944
Let's connect your first

00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:03.179
channel in Recatch.

00:00:03.249 --> 00:00:05.258
We'll use Telegram, because all it

00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:06.748
needs is a bot token.

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:08.853
Step one. Go to recatch.app

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:10.707
and create your account.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.614
On the Create your workspace

00:00:12.614 --> 00:00:14.517
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:16.091
email, and a password of

00:00:16.091 --> 00:00:17.785
at least 8 characters.

00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:19.335
Then click Create account.

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:21.223
Step two. Recatch takes you

00:00:21.223 --> 00:00:23.356
straight to the Channels screen.

00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:25.383
Under Connect a channel, Telegram

00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:26.984
is already selected, with a

00:00:26.984 --> 00:00:28.597
short guide underneath.

00:00:28.897 --> 00:00:30.766
Step three. Open Telegram

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:32.735
and talk to @BotFather.

00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:34.074
Create a bot, and copy

00:00:34.074 --> 00:00:35.651
the token it gives you.

00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:37.174
This one is a fake example.

00:00:37.174 --> 00:00:39.361
Your real token will look different.

00:00:39.431 --> 00:00:40.726
Treat it like a password,

00:00:40.726 --> 00:00:41.961
and never share it.

00:00:42.261 --> 00:00:44.101
Step four. Back in Recatch,

00:00:44.101 --> 00:00:45.736
paste the token into the

00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:47.077
Bot token field.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.122
It stays hidden as

00:00:48.122 --> 00:00:49.076
you paste it.

00:00:49.376 --> 00:00:51.206
Step five. Click Connect

00:00:51.206 --> 00:00:52.676
and set webhook.

00:00:52.746 --> 00:00:54.649
Recatch checks the token, stores

00:00:54.649 --> 00:00:56.196
it encrypted, and sets the

00:00:56.196 --> 00:00:57.397
webhook for you.

00:00:57.697 --> 00:00:59.077
When it's done, you'll see

00:00:59.077 --> 00:01:00.457
a Connected message, and a

00:01:00.457 --> 00:01:01.625
card for your bot with

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:03.096
its status and webhook.

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:04.235
You can run a health check

00:01:04.235 --> 00:01:05.596
from that card at any time.

00:01:05.896 --> 00:01:07.524
That's it. Your Telegram

00:01:07.524 --> 00:01:08.926
bot is connected.

00:01:08.996 --> 00:01:10.749
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:10.749 --> 00:01:12.814
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:12.814 --> 00:01:14.003
a blank canvas.
